{"sections":{"main":{"type":"page","disabled":true,"settings":{"kicker":"","kicker_size":3,"show_title":true,"title_size":8,"show_content":true,"content_size":5,"align_text":"text-left","text_color":"text--neutral","bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"9fe44a68-e93b-4df9-b3a5-cb51c07daee5":{"type":"section-richtext","blocks":{"template--16974173372628__9fe44a68-e93b-4df9-b3a5-cb51c07daee5-heading-1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"HUELLA DE CARBONO","text_size":8}},"template--16974173372628__9fe44a68-e93b-4df9-b3a5-cb51c07daee5-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Junto a nuestros amigos de GreenTicket, quienes llevan más de 10 años asesorando marcas y empresas para definir, medir, activar y comunicar su propia huella sustentable, estamos midiendo nuestra huella de carbono, buscando mitigar y reducir nuestro impacto medioambiental a través de la mejora de nuestros procesos.<\/p>","text_size":4,"text_columns":1}}},"block_order":["template--16974173372628__9fe44a68-e93b-4df9-b3a5-cb51c07daee5-heading-1","template--16974173372628__9fe44a68-e93b-4df9-b3a5-cb51c07daee5-text-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"text-center","text_color":"text--neutral","bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","content_width":2000,"width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"section_richtext_fKAqwp":{"type":"section-richtext","blocks":{"kicker_Q66pRr":{"type":"kicker","settings":{"kicker":"¿CÓMO HEMOS AVANZADO?","enable_line":false,"text_size":5}},"text_knzFNN":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Durante el año 2022 medimos,  junto a la empresa SocialGreen, por primera vez nuestra huella correspondiente al año 2021 (Alcances 1 y 2). A través del programa \"Mitiga tu Huella\" de SocialGreen proveniente de la ONU, mitigamos nuestra huella 2021, equivalente a 38 toneladas de CO2. El proyecto en el cual apalancamos nuestra huella es de triple impacto a la comunidad donde se desarrolla, dando trabajo, bienestar social e impacto positivo al medio ambiente. <strong>Puedes ver el certificado acá.<\/strong><\/p>","text_size":4,"text_columns":1}}},"block_order":["kicker_Q66pRr","text_knzFNN"],"settings":{"align_text":"text-center","text_color":"text--neutral","bg":"palette--light bg--accent","content_width":2000,"width":"wrapper","padding_top":18,"padding_bottom":0}},"9f0af102-03bf-484c-bcb4-6d36f967211d":{"type":"section-columns","blocks":{"3a0487d9-1c48-4a5a-8fde-3d0f8b20b25b":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/HUELLA_CARBONO.webp","title":"","text":"","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_color":"btn--neutral","button_style":"btn--soft","enable_video":false,"video_link":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=_9VUPq3SxOc"}},"889d823d-7bc2-4d46-8c35-a4f717080c6d":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/MEDIR_HUELLA.webp","title":"","text":"","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_color":"btn--neutral","button_style":"btn--soft","enable_video":false,"video_link":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=_9VUPq3SxOc"}},"d46d502d-2b00-4b80-81aa-70f4adcd0072":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/EN_QUE_ESTAMOS_1571414f-63d1-492d-8081-8a871ce33fdc.webp","title":"","text":"","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_color":"btn--neutral","button_style":"btn--soft","enable_video":false,"video_link":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=_9VUPq3SxOc"}}},"block_order":["3a0487d9-1c48-4a5a-8fde-3d0f8b20b25b","889d823d-7bc2-4d46-8c35-a4f717080c6d","d46d502d-2b00-4b80-81aa-70f4adcd0072"],"settings":{"title":"","bg":"palette--light bg--accent","align_text":"text-center","scale_image":true,"wh_ratio":1,"grid_large":3,"grid_medium":3,"grid_mobile":1.2,"progress_bar_mobile":false,"width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"b187d184-b666-4777-9ad3-b4fc42f8ef6c":{"type":"section-double","blocks":{"template--16971078959316__b187d184-b666-4777-9ad3-b4fc42f8ef6c-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"kicker":"ALCANCES DE LA MEDICIÓN","title":"","text":"<p>La huella de carbono corporativa de mide durante un año calendario y agrupa las emisiones de GEI en 3 alcances:<\/p><p>- Emisiones directas (Alcance 1): emisiones que provienen de fuentes que son propiedad o son controladas por la empresa (combustibles fósiles, climatización)<\/p><p>- Emisiones indirectas por consumo y distribución de energía (Alcance 2): emisiones asociadas al consumo de electricidad<\/p><p>- Otras emisiones indirectas (Alcance 3): emisiones no controladas por la empresa (transporte de funcionarios, viajes de trabajo, transporte de insumos, generación de residuos, entre otros.<\/p>","font_size":4,"text_columns":1,"align_text":"text-left","button_text":"","button_url":"","button_color":"btn--neutral","button_style":"btn-text-thick-line","text_color":"text--neutral","bg_color":""}},"template--16971078959316__b187d184-b666-4777-9ad3-b4fc42f8ef6c-image-1":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/alcances_huella.webp","overlay_opacity":0,"overlay_color":"#000000","enable_overlay_text":false,"kicker":"","title":"","richtext":"","text_align":"align--middle-center","text_color":"text--white","link_text":"","link":"","button_color":"btn--white","button_style":"btn"}}},"block_order":["template--16971078959316__b187d184-b666-4777-9ad3-b4fc42f8ef6c-text-1","template--16971078959316__b187d184-b666-4777-9ad3-b4fc42f8ef6c-image-1"],"settings":{"height":"use_screen_one_half","brick_gutter":40,"borders":false,"bg_color":"","preload_image":false,"width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}}},"order":["main","9fe44a68-e93b-4df9-b3a5-cb51c07daee5","section_richtext_fKAqwp","9f0af102-03bf-484c-bcb4-6d36f967211d","b187d184-b666-4777-9ad3-b4fc42f8ef6c"]}